  "description": "<p>Where appropriate, update the revisions to the atomic updates specific PR:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-specification-atomic-operations/pull/8/files\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo-specification-atomic-operations/pull/8/files</a></p>\n\n<p>Based on work from the implementation of the specification. This should include more detail on status codes, as well as some revisions to those status. Could also propose the GET method for checking the status of a transaction without refreshing it. And could also clarify how the expiration time is presented to clients during transaction creation.</p>",
